Maintainer: WiFi Spectrum Studio <maintainers@wifispectrum.studio>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets | python3-pyside6, python3-pyqtgraph, python3-numpy, iw, network-manager
Recommends: python3-soapysdr
Description: Wireless spectrum and Wi-Fi analysis studio
 WiFi Spectrum Studio visualises channel occupancy, congestion and signal
 strength from real operating-system scan results, keeps a local SQLite
 history and exports HTML, CSV, JSON and PDF reports.
 .
 Wi-Fi curves are channel-shaped visualisations derived from scan data, not
 FFT measurements. True FFT traces require a supported SoapySDR device.
